{
    "title": "Family Dollar",
    "description": "Get ready to do more with the NEW Family Dollar app! Crafted brand new and just for you, the new app takes your shopping experience to the next level with new features, a fresh look, more opportunities to save, and beyond\u2014all to help you do more.\r\n\r\nEnjoy additional savings, convenience, and features at your fingertips with the new Family Dollar app. Download now to start doing more and watching your savings soar!\r\n\r\nThe new Family Dollar app offers you more than convenience, including ways to shop smarter and save more money. It\u2019s easy to score great savings by clipping new coupons every week on your favorite brands, tracking your Smart Coupons savings over time, staying current on hot offers, and more! Plus, new features which allow you to filter searches, see product reviews and ratings, check out trending coupons, and others.\r\n\r\nLooking for hot deals while shopping in store? Using the barcode scanner in your app, you can scan product barcodes to check for coupons on the items you\u2019re interested in. With new deals and hot offers for every week, season, and occasion, the possibilities to save are endless!\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s easy to redeem your coupons for savings. All you do is scan your unique barcode within the app at checkout in store and watch your lifetime savings grow\u2014all at your fingertips!\r\n\r\nIn addition to more ways to shop and save, the new Family Dollar app offers you a new tailored experience.\r\n\r\nReady to get started? Download to start clipping, saving, and doing more with the new Family Dollar app!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready to do more with the NEW Family Dollar app! Crafted brand new and just for you, the new app takes your shopping experience to the next level with new features, a fresh look, more opportunities to save, and beyond\u2014all to help you do more.<br><br>Enjoy additional savings, convenience, and features at your fingertips with the new Family Dollar app. Download now to start doing more and watching your savings soar!<br><br>The new Family Dollar app offers you more than convenience, including ways to shop smarter and save more money. It\u2019s easy to score great savings by clipping new coupons every week on your favorite brands, tracking your Smart Coupons savings over time, staying current on hot offers, and more! Plus, new features which allow you to filter searches, see product reviews and ratings, check out trending coupons, and others.<br><br>Looking for hot deals while shopping in store? Using the barcode scanner in your app, you can scan product barcodes to check for coupons on the items you\u2019re interested in. With new deals and hot offers for every week, season, and occasion, the possibilities to save are endless!<br><br>It\u2019s easy to redeem your coupons for savings. All you do is scan your unique barcode within the app at checkout in store and watch your lifetime savings grow\u2014all at your fingertips!<br><br>In addition to more ways to shop and save, the new Family Dollar app offers you a new tailored experience.<br><br>Ready to get started? Download to start clipping, saving, and doing more with the new Family Dollar app!",
